Arduino_LSM6DS3 1.1.0 - 2026.09.01

* Fix readGyroscope() scaling: use the datasheet sensitivity of 70 mdps/LSB for
  the FS = +/-2000 dps setting instead of 2000/32768. Reported angular rates
  were ~12.8% low.

